                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "The URLs reference the master branch of an external repository. If the upstream files are updated or moved in a future commit, the downloaded profiles may differ from v1.1.0 without any indication, silently changing test behavior. usually main and master is used in community, \n\nwhat you can do it, \n```\n${ocp_branch_name}     master\n```\n\nPin to a specific branch; update intentionally in the URL\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencomputeproject/HWMgmt-OCP-Profiles/${ocp_branch_name}/OCPBaselineHardwareManagement.v1_1_0.json\n\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencomputeproject/HWMgmt-OCP-Profiles/${ocp_branch_name}/Server/OCPServerHardwareManagement.v1_1_0.json\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/dmtf_tools/Redfish_Interop_Validator.robot",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Praful Radadiya",
                        "email": "prafulradadiya101@gmail.com",
                        "username": "prafulradadiya101"
