                    },
                    "message": "```\nTest BMC Redfish Using Redfish Interop Validator-OCP Hardware Management Profiles v1_1_0\n```\n\nupdate the test case nane amd Tag\n\nThe abbreviated name is harder to parse at a glance and does not follow the project's convention of full descriptive test names."
