                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Capture and validate the return code:\n```\n${rc}  ${output}=  Shell Cmd  wget -q -O ${ocp_baseline_profile_path} ${ocp_baseline_profile_url}\nShould Be Equal As Integers  ${rc}  0  Failed to download OCP baseline profile: ${output}\n${rc}  ${output}=  Shell Cmd  wget -q -O ${ocp_server_profile_path} ${ocp_server_profile_url}\nShould Be Equal As Integers  ${rc}  0  Failed to download OCP server profile: ${output}\n```\n\nExplicit failure at the download step surfaces the root cause immediately rather than propagating a silent error."
                },
